  "axes": "glTF +Y up, front faces +Z. Each root sits at its origin = top centre of a lab_shell plinth pad.",
  "placement": "Parent station_<n>_*.glb's root under lab_shell's Station_n node with an identity transform: Station_n's front (glTF +Z) faces the camera path, the same as these props.",
