    "*_Screen nodes are flat UV 0-1 faces using the 'Screen' material (dark, emissive black): set emissive to white and use the UI texture as emissiveMap.",
    "Multi-material meshes load in three.js as a Group named after the node with child meshes <name>_1, <name>_2...; animate the named Group.",
    "Holo_Green is alpha 0.35 BLEND."
